<h3 data-section-id="1jm315j" data-start="96" data-end="138">🚀 একটু Creative Engineering Web Ideas</h3>
<ol data-start="140" data-end="1845">
<li data-section-id="23qg41" data-start="140" data-end="286">
<p data-start="143" data-end="286"><strong data-start="143" data-end="160">🔍 EngiFinder</strong><br data-start="160" data-end="163">
Engineering students-এর জন্য resource search engine।<br data-start="218" data-end="221">
<code data-start="224" data-end="286">Topic → Notes → YouTube → PDF → Formula → Previous Questions</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1h0n4ep" data-start="288" data-end="462">
<p data-start="291" data-end="462"><strong data-start="291" data-end="315">🧩 CircuitLab Online</strong><br data-start="315" data-end="318">
Browser-এ basic electrical/electronics circuit তৈরি করে দেখতে পারবে।<br data-start="389" data-end="392">
Resistor, LED, battery, switch ইত্যাদি দিয়ে ছোট circuit simulation।</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="crw0qn" data-start="464" data-end="690">
<p data-start="467" data-end="536" class="" style=""><strong data-start="467" data-end="501">🏗️ Engineering Calculator 2.0</strong><br data-start="501" data-end="504">
শুধু calculator না—এক জায়গায়:</p>
<ul data-start="540" data-end="690">
<li data-section-id="1tkvt5f" data-start="540" data-end="548">
<p data-start="542" data-end="548">Matrix</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9i0eoh" data-start="552" data-end="560">
<p data-start="554" data-end="560">Vector</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="n3wj9n" data-start="564" data-end="580">
<p data-start="566" data-end="580">Complex number</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12he1gs" data-start="584" data-end="595">
<p data-start="586" data-end="595">Ohm's law</p>
