<li data-section-id="1bp2ke4" data-start="692" data-end="877">
<p data-start="695" data-end="877"><strong data-start="695" data-end="728">🧑‍🔬 Virtual Engineering Lab</strong><br data-start="728" data-end="731">
বাস্তব lab-এর মতো interactive experiment।<br data-start="775" data-end="778">
যেমন Physics/Chemistry/Electrical experiment select → apparatus → values → calculation → result।</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1k4jjcj" data-start="879" data-end="1070">
<p data-start="882" data-end="926"><strong data-start="882" data-end="906">📊 Student Analytics</strong><br data-start="906" data-end="909">
Student নিজের:</p>
<ul data-start="930" data-end="1013">
<li data-section-id="f5atbj" data-start="930" data-end="942">
<p data-start="932" data-end="942">Attendance</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16vtjji" data-start="946" data-end="953">
