</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1017" data-end="1070">input করলে dashboard-এ পুরো academic progress দেখাবে।</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1j6fe9t" data-start="1072" data-end="1225">
<p data-start="1075" data-end="1225"><strong data-start="1075" data-end="1105">💻 CodeArena for Beginners</strong><br data-start="1105" data-end="1108">
1st-year students-এর জন্য programming practice।<br data-start="1158" data-end="1161">
C/Python/Java → Easy → Medium → Hard → ছোট coding challenges।</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="50s4xl" data-start="1227" data-end="1374">
<p data-start="1230" data-end="1374"><strong data-start="1230" data-end="1247">⚡ FormulaRace</strong><br data-start="1247" data-end="1250">
Formula মুখস্থ করার game।<br data-start="1278" data-end="1281">
একটা problem আসবে → 4টা formula → দ্রুত সঠিকটা select করতে হবে।<br data-start="1347" data-end="1350">
Score + streak থাকবে।</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lw23jk" data-start="1376" data-end="1512">
<p data-start="1379" data-end="1512"><strong data-start="1379" data-end="1396">🎤 VivaMaster</strong><br data-start="1396" data-end="1399">
Lab viva practice website।<br data-start="1428" data-end="1431">
Subject/experiment select করলে random viva questions করবে এবং শেষে score দেবে।</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tq0tda" data-start="1514" data-end="1799">
<p data-start="1517" data-end="1613"><strong data-start="1517" data-end="1544">🗺️ Engineering Roadmap</strong><br data-start="1544" data-end="1547">
একজন 1st-year student কোন বছর কী শিখবে তার interactive roadmap:</p>
<p data-start="1618" data-end="1799"><strong data-start="1618" data-end="1659">1st Year → Programming + Fundamentals</strong><br data-start="1659" data-end="1662">
↓<br data-start="1666" data-end="1669">
<strong data-start="1672" data-end="1698">2nd Year → Core Skills</strong><br data-start="1698" data-end="1701">
↓<br data-start="1705" data-end="1708">
<strong data-start="1711" data-end="1747">3rd Year → Projects + Internship</strong><br data-start="1747" data-end="1750">
↓<br data-start="1754" data-end="1757">
<strong data-start="1760" data-end="1799">4th Year → Placement/Higher Studies</strong></p>
</li>
